  "summary": "The experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal setup using PCA and ResNet50 encoders, comparing it to the previous concat fusion. Validation accuracy (0.5232) and F1 (0.5084) are slightly lower than the baseline (0.5266 and 0.5104), suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance. Uncertainty remains about the optimal fusion strategy and potential benefits from other encoder configurations."
